  m_text: We can easily find evidence of the newly elevated status of software all
    around us. Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the most representative example. "AlphaGo,"
    which was introduced to the world by Google DeepMind a few years ago, became
    an important measure by which we can estimate the extent to which the power of
    software will develop.
